 if d['place']=='Old cancelled phrase after Gamma-Q':d.update(reading=r'\deleted{$\Gamma_{\mathbb Q}$, '+new+'}',alternatives='qui est / qui définit',reason='The first loop and following obscured outlines admit the blind reader’s phrase alternatives, but the heavy strike and the new groupe descender still cover the old letters. The physically unreadable primary word is not silently completed.')
